      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "blk_jsew4bwa3g",
          "type": "heading",
          "v": 1,
          "fields": {
            "text": "What guides us.",
            "level": "h2",
            "size": "auto",
            "eyebrow": "Six Values",
            "subheading": "We envision a flourishing and resilient Front Range Bioregion now and for future generations culturing through living relational networks and coordinating through decentralized Commons infrastructure."
          },
          "variant": "plain"
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_cmh2xajpp1",
          "type": "columns",
          "v": 1,
          "fields": {
            "items": [
              {
                "heading": "Healthy Local Ecologies",
                "body": {
                  "type": "doc",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Air quality monitoring, watershed stewardship, soil health programs, fire mitigation landscaping — land and water cared for by the people who live with them."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "heading": "Mutual Care Already in Place",
                "body": {
                  "type": "doc",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Knowing who on the block needs to be checked on and who has skills, tools, or supplies to share. Connected, local relationships so that when something goes wrong, we don't have to figure it out alone."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "heading": "Local Resource Access",
                "body": {
                  "type": "doc",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Community water systems, neighborhood farm exchanges (surplus from one yard to the table next door), distributed tool libraries, shared transportation, clothing swaps, potlucks!"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "heading": "Resilient Local Energy",
                "body": {
                  "type": "doc",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Community solar arrays, neighborhood microgrids, shared generators, battery co-ops — so when the grid trips, we and our neighbors stay warm."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "heading": "Community-held Digital Communication Systems",
                "body": {
                  "type": "doc",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Mesh networks and community-held servers and datacenters that work when centralized systems fail."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "heading": "Vibrant Community Spirit",
                "body": {
                  "type": "doc",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "A shared sense of home and kinship that runs deeper than the basic fact of proximity. Intergenerational knowledge-sharing and -caring. The feeling that we "
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "belong",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "italic"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": " to places and people who are known to us."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ],
            "columns": "3",
            "aspect": "4:5"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_pn11m745wd",
          "type": "text",
          "v": 1,
          "fields": {
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "We are attempting in good faith the nearly-impossible but necessary work of weaving our communities back together with the life that sustains us all."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_z7vekxre4s",
